 z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .film-content.photos {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 4px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 180px;\n  }\n\n  .photo-cell {\n    background: #3a5a7a;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #ccc;\n  }\n\n  .film-content.cartoon {\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .film-content.illustration {\n    background: #2a6a4a;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .cartoon-face {\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 100px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .cartoon-face .head {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border: 3px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 50% 50% 45% 45%;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .cartoon-face .cap {\n    width: 75px;\n    height: 25px;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -10px;\n    left: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .cartoon-face .eye {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .cartoon-face .eye.left { left: 18px; }\n  .cartoon-face .eye.right { right: 18px; }\n\n  .cartoon-face .mouth {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border: 2px solid #c0392b;\n    border-top: none;\n    border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    left: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .illustration-face {\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 140px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #e8734a 0%, #d4623a 30%, #c4956a 50%, #d4a574 70%, #c4956a 100%);\n    border-radius: 50% 50% 45% 45%;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .illustration-face .hair {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 60px;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -10px;\n    left: -5px;\n  }\n\n  .illustration-face .eye {\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 6px;\n    background: #222;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n  }\n\n  .illustration-face .eye.left { left: 28px; }\n  .illustration-face .eye.right { right: 28px; }\n\n  .illustration-face .nose {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 12px;\n    background: #b8845a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 65px;\n    left: 46px;\n  }\n\n  .illustration-face .mouth {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #8b4513;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 85px;\n    left: 42px;\n  }\n\n  .author-name {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    text-align: justify;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    color: #333;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .body-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n\n  .column-divider {\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #ccc;\n    align-self: stretch;\n  }\n\n  .film-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #aaa;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    z-index: 4;\n  }\n\n  .film-label.left-label {\n    left: 20px;\n    top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .film-label.right-label {\n    right: 20px;\n    top: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n  <!-- Column 1 -->\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <div class=\"film-strip\">\n      <div class=\"sprockets left\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sprockets right\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-content photos\">\n        <div class=\"photo-cell\" style=\"background:#4a6a8a;\">\n          <div style=\"width:40px;height:50px;background:#5a7a9a;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;color:#ddd;\">[Photo]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"photo-cell\" style=\"background:#3a5a7a;\">\n          <div style=\"width:40px;height:50px;background:#4a6a8a;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;color:#ddd;\">[Photo]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"photo-cell\" style=\"background:#3a5a7a;\">\n          <div style=\"width:40px;height:50px;background:#4a6a8a;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;color:#ddd;\">[Photo]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"photo-cell\" style=\"background:#4a6a8a;\">\n          <div style=\"width:40px;height:50px;background:#5a7a9a;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;color:#ddd;\">[Photo]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"author-name\">井 上 雄 彦</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>最近，我突然想养只狗。</p>\n      <p>小时候，我非常喜欢猫、狗之类的动物，记得自己曾经给邻家的狗随便取名叫\"卡洛\"，跟它一起玩。</p>\n      <p>我现在的街坊也养着一只大狗，名字叫\"银次\"。当我从隔壁家不多跟我一般高的驼鹿外喊\"银次\"的时候，它就会伸出大大的脑袋，并把两只大大的前爪搭在院墙上，一直盯着我。每当这时，我就想如果自己养一只大狗该多好呀。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"column-divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Column 2 -->\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <div class=\"film-strip\">\n      <div class=\"sprockets left\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sprockets right\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-content cartoon\">\n        <div class=\"cartoon-face\">\n          <div class=\"cap\"></div>\n          <div class=\"head\">\n            <div class=\"eye left\"></div>\n            <div class=\"eye right\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mouth\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"author-name\">井 上 雄 彦</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>刚开始画\"灌篮高手\"时的愿望，如今已经实现了两个。</p>\n      <p>一个是以采访为名前往美国观看NBA的决赛。另一个也是以采访为名前往巴塞罗那现场观看奥运会。真要感谢上帝。</p>\n      <p>下一个愿望是希望能看到日本篮球队获得奥运会的出场权。那些少年读者曾经在来信中写到：\"自从连载了《灌篮高手》后就开始打篮球了\"。如果这些孩子们长大之后能实现我的梦想的话……我一定会激动得放声大哭</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"column-divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Column 3 -->\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <div class=\"film-strip\" style=\"background:#1a3a2a;\">\n      <div class=\"sprockets left\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sprockets right\">\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n        <div class=\"sprocket-hole\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-content illustration\">\n        <div class=\"illustration-face\">\n          <div class=\"hair\"></div>\n          <div class=\"eye left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"eye right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"nose\"></div>\n          <div class=\"mouth\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"author-name\">井 上 雄 彦</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>多亏大家的支持，《灌篮高手》才能出版第10卷，衷心感谢各位读者朋友。</p>\n      <p>自开始连载已经过去了两年，然而故事中才刚过两个月。如果连载了两年才过两个月的话，那樱木他们升高二的时候岂不是还要等12年，到他们毕业的话，还要等36年……</p>\n      <p>我想不会的……</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
